  "description": "LUVQIE crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C28 H38 N8 Ni2 O22 Tb2,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Ni1 (Ni) has 4 O neighbors; Tb1 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 4 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.076-3.440 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.56-106.54°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Tb2Ni2C32H44N10O22. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
